{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922022153_de32a176","chunk_index":14,"job_id":"mwjob_8447f85a17afe47f1dddc26c","precondition_digest":"7349d025237003fc2a71649e47dc3f181ea6e6f1b327c41c9a0c64a4929460d8","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v6","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_39e4b116abc0cd5e","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_25e1c06d0b06aa86","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_88e2c46a69d01a79","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_3a0ca66f9b437b15"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922022153_de32a176","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"不良事件的采集与记录","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节研究实施规则的项目权威资料或职能确认"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"已确认事实：安全性终点包括TEAE、SAE及导致停药的不良事件发生率，安全性评价还包括实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图；研究时期包含16周双盲治疗期和4周安全性随访期。医学作者需核对：不良事件的统一定义、记录载体与字段、采集起止时点、责任分工，以及操作相关事件和首次用药前事件的记录原则。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_39e4b116abc0cd5e","section_number":"8.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:09cd5cca90a97517eaf9cea6","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:272acba4ac29f2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922022153_de32a176","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:09cd5cca90a97517eaf9cea6","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_25e1c06d0b06aa86\n章节编号=8.5\n章节标题=不良事件的评估","quote_sha256":"d58626ffb2aa736448dd3e6c9e2b64d85e0b349398010e53c225a3eb7e45351f","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:09cd5cca90a97517eaf9cea6","span_id":"span_sel_85"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_safety"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_period"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_85","span_proj_safety","span_proj_period"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"heading":"不良事件的评估","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"对研究期间医学事件的评估应以保障受试者安全、支持安全性终点评价为目标。对于双盲治疗期（16周）及安全性随访期（4周）内采集的医学事件，应结合受试者的临床表现、实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图结果进行综合判断，以明确事件的性质及其对受试者安全的影响。评估应在不同中心和不同时间点之间保持一致，结论应有充分依据，并能够与原始记录相互印证。对于评估所采用的具体分级标准、相关性判断方法和评估流程，应在本研究的安全性管理要求中统一规定，以保证安全性数据分析的可靠性。","rationale":"已确认事实：安全性终点包括TEAE、SAE及导致停药的不良事件发生率，安全性评价还包括实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图。医学作者需核对：不良事件严重程度分级、严重性判断、与试验药物相关性评估的具体标准和方法，以及评估流程在各中心的统一要求。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_25e1c06d0b06aa86","section_number":"8.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:09cd5cca90a97517eaf9cea6","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:272acba4ac29f2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922022153_de32a176","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"不良事件的报告","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节研究实施规则的项目权威资料或职能确认"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"已确认事实：严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件属于安全性终点，研究设有16周双盲治疗期和4周安全性随访期。医学作者需核对：严重不良事件与导致停药不良事件的报告对象、报告路径、报告时限及与其他安全性信息报告流程的衔接要求。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_88e2c46a69d01a79","section_number":"8.6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:09cd5cca90a97517eaf9cea6","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:272acba4ac29f2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922022153_de32a176","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:09cd5cca90a97517eaf9cea6","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_3a0ca66f9b437b15\n章节编号=8.7\n章节标题=不良事件的随访","quote_sha256":"edfcfb3bfaa5c770c965dedb9546b1e39609ddd353d367219fdb20a6271ca339","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:09cd5cca90a97517eaf9cea6","span_id":"span_sel_87"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_period"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_visit"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_safety"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_87","span_proj_period","span_proj_visit","span_proj_safety"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"不良事件的随访","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"对已发生医学事件的随访旨在持续了解其转归及对受试者安全的影响，为安全性终点评价和受试者安全管理提供完整信息。本研究设有4周安全性随访期，并在第20周安排安全性随访访视；对双盲治疗期（16周）及安全性随访期（4周）内发生的医学事件，应根据事件性质和临床需要开展随访，并将随访结果与实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图等安全性评价信息相关联。随访获得的信息应准确、完整地记录，并与原始资料保持一致，以支持最终的安全性分析。对于随访的具体终点、持续时间和实施方式，应在本研究的安全性管理要求中统一明确。","rationale":"已确认事实：研究设有4周安全性随访期，第20周进行安全性随访，安全性评价涵盖实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图。医学作者需核对：不良事件随访的具体终点、持续时间、妊娠事件是否纳入随访以及随访记录方式。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_3a0ca66f9b437b15","section_number":"8.7","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:09cd5cca90a97517eaf9cea6","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:272acba4ac29f2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_2026071